NEW FEATURES AS OF V7.a
=======================

* Please note, this version REQUIRES C-Net 2.35 or greater to run. I
  use some of the new REXX Commands in this version, it also is a
  nice form of copy protection. Now all you slobs with Pirate setups
  can't run it! Hyar hyar hyar!!

  7.0a  = This is THE LASTEST! (As of Nov 19th)
        >>WARNING! The Text.Quotes file has changed, please copy the new
          one over!
        * Now, uses the new PROMPT command so checking for 77 or more
          characters is now obsolete!
        * Now sets the "Where?" column in a WHo command for "T-Quote"
        * Now uses all 16 colours of C-Net for more beauty! Ooo!!
        * Fixed bugs in SYSOP MAINT, previously when you changed a
          quote, it would use my colours - now conforms to LINTEX,
          TIMTEX, and HANTEX specified in files! OooO!!!
        * Now has a more professional 3-D style look to it. OooOOO!
        * Is a tad cleaner and a little faster... replaced "tr'';tr xx"
          for a simple "tr '\n1'xx".. less command hunting for poor
          ol' CPU! Yay!
        * Now SUCCESSFULLY removed the racial slurs put into the
          cute mode (Ahem.. the "I HATE NIG..RS" one... I don't know
          what came over me when I wrote that. Some of my best friends
          are black!).
        * NOTICE! It is not recommended to use more than 5 quotes. It
          will work perfectly if you do, but I disabled the "More?"
          mode so people with 23-line screens don't have to hit "Y"
          when the screen for TQuote fills up. This means if you use
          say 6-1000 quotes.. umm.. hee hee.. get my drift??
        * Oh great... more dirty words in the removal system! Be sure
          to check them to make sure they are the ones you want.. >:)
        * More Cute-Mode sayings have been added in.. check and make
          sure they are the ones you like. >:)
        * Fixed cute mode spelling error.. it's "poontang" not
          "puntang".

