  is simple, all you do is call my board and vo'ila! You're registered!

  Also, any damamages (HOW??) that come to your system that is the fault
  of TQuote is NOT my responsability! You're the Sysop and should have
  control over what yer users can and cannot do. It's not my fault if
  you're a dolt and can't read the C-Net docs. Or, if you are some pirate
